Local agent context experiments

The experimental design was prompted by:
Fork-and-Flush: Escaping Idea Basins in Autoresearch Agents
https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.07447

This is an independent pilot, not an official implementation or replication of
the paper. No endorsement by its authors is implied.

The inference runner depends on @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent 0.84.2.
That package is distributed separately under its own licence and notices.
Its source is not included here. No model weights are included.

The runs directory contains unedited model-generated experiment outputs,
including invalid programs. They are evidence, not vetted library code.
